fact WorkItem(id: "WI-120", description: some(value: "Proposal 030 phase α.8 (re-scoped): implement Specialization composition by deriving 'provides' from requires-clause ProofRecords. After WI-119 brainstorm settles the design, walk: for each parametric spec S with auto-registered <S-qn>.requires.<SE> records, and each concrete sort X, check whether X has Discharged ProofRecords for each of S's requires-laws under substitution [T = X]. If yes, emit Specialization{ parametric: <S-qn>.requires.<SE>, substitution: [(T, X)], instances: [<X-qn>.<...>] } ProofRecords. Repurposes load_provides_clause as a check: the user's source-level 'provides A[T = X]' must have supporting proofs (error if not). Replaces the stub register_specialization_witnesses landed in WI-118."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-119"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-28T12:13:40Z"))
